   "source": [
    "# EDSR x2 on DIV2K\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook is rewritten to follow the single-scale `x2` EDSR setup from Lim et al., *Enhanced Deep Residual Networks for Single Image Super-Resolution* (CVPRW 2017), adapted to the local DIV2K folder layout.\n",
    "\n",
    "Implemented paper details:\n",
    "- Single-scale EDSR for bicubic `x2` super-resolution\n",
    "- `B = 32` residual blocks, `F = 256` feature channels\n",
    "- No batch normalization\n",
    "- Residual scaling `0.1`\n",
    "- LR patch size `48 x 48` with matching HR patches\n",
    "- Random horizontal flips and `90` degree rotations during training\n",
    "- Mean RGB subtraction using the DIV2K training set mean\n",
    "- `L1` loss, Adam (`beta1=0.9`, `beta2=0.999`, `eps=1e-8`)\n",
    "- Learning rate starts at `1e-4` and is halved every `200000` minibatch updates\n",
    "- Validation on the official DIV2K validation split with RGB PSNR/SSIM and border shave `6 + scale`\n"
   ]
  },
